  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/27/carved-pumpkins-title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"711\" height=\"336\"></strong></span></h1><h1>在《Minecraft》中新增<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>8種全新的雕刻南瓜</strong></span>設計！<br><br>只需手持<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>剪刀</strong></span>對<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>雕刻</strong></span>南瓜<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>右鍵點擊</strong></span>，便能循環切換設計！<br><br>同時也加入了<span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>雕刻西瓜</strong></span>，提供2種靈感源自<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Minecraft </span><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Earth</span></strong>的設計！</h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>所有雕刻南瓜設計：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/792/pumpkin.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"744\" height=\"192\"></p><p><strong>所有雕刻西瓜設計：</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/791/melons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"743\" height=\"324\"></strong></p><p>所有材質由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/nanoattack/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nanoattack</a> 提供</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1127560/description_aa560ec9-0cdd-40fd-835c-a03d9709ca0b.png\"></p>",
